        "Content": "Exceptional coastal property just a 2-minute walk from the beach\r\nThoughtfully designed with two self-contained residences within the one property\r\nDetached one-bedroom chalet offering additional guest or income potential\r\nSea views from parts of the property\r\nIdeal family home with established guest accommodation and multi-generational living potential\r\nWalking distance to Jack’s Coastguard Restaurant and The Boathouse Café\r\nMoments from Rossbeigh and Glenbeigh beaches and the Wild Atlantic Way\r\nApproximately 10 minutes to Killorglin with schools, shops, cafés and everyday amenities\r\nWithin easy reach of Kerry Airport and approximately 40 minutes to Killarney\r\nBeautifully presented throughout and ready for immediate occupation"
      }
